cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use TreeKnit, please cite the article that describes the method."
type: "software"
title: "TreeKnit"
abstract: "TreeKnit infers reassortment from the trees of the segments of a virus: maximally compatible clades (MCCs) for every pair of trees, trees with polytomies resolved using the other trees, and for two trees an ancestral reassortment graph (ARG)."
authors:
